{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771","id":32866051,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMjg2NjA1MQ==","number":4771,"title":"transformControl touch screen Cannot read property 'clientX' of undefined","user":{"login":"gehuangyi20","id":3879058,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzkwNTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3879058?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20","html_url":"https://github.com/gehuangyi20","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gehuangyi20/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2014-05-06T04:53:55Z","updated_at":"2015-07-01T04:16:24Z","closed_at":"2015-07-01T04:16:24Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I got this error when the finger leave the screen\n![image](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/3879058/2886017/22e573ce-d4d8-11e3-969a-a1ed139947ce.png)\n\nThe problem occurs at transformControl.js on line 727\n\n``` javascript\nvar pointer = event.touches ? event.touches[0] : event;\n```\n\nonPointerUp was called after finger leave the screen. Then the length of event.touches  is 0.\n\nHere is the solution.\n\n``` javascript\n/* change touches to changedTouches*/\nvar pointer = event.touches ? event.changedTouches[0] : event;\n```\n\nFor touch screen, each touch event includes three lists of touches:\n\n`touches`: a list of all fingers currently on the screen.\n`targetTouches`: a list of fingers on the current `DOM` element.\n`changedTouches`: a list of fingers involved in the current event. For example, in a `touchend` event, this will be the finger that was removed.\n\nTherefore, `touches` will be empty after the finger leave the screen. But `changedTouches` will still contain the finger information. So, change to ``changedTouches` will work. I have tested it on Chrome touch screen simulator and my iPad. No error throw.\n\nThe following link describe the `touch event` in `HTML5`.\nhttp://www.html5rocks.com/en/mobile/touch/\n","closed_by":{"login":"dubejf","id":8649151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NDkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8649151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf","html_url":"https://github.com/dubejf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubejf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/4771/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}